R\")\"\n  exit $rc\nfi\n\n# Exit 0 is not proof of work: require non-empty output.\nif [[ ! -s \"$OUT\" ]]; then\n  notify \"nightly review FAILED: exit 0 but empty output after ${dur}s, see $ERR\"\n  exit 2\nfi\n\nnotify \"nightly review done (${dur}s): $(head -c 300 \"$OUT\")\"\n"}}}
